{"id":"lele-512","title":"202409 青少年等级考试机器人理论真题二级","subject":"robot","subjectName":"电子学会机器人","level":2,"yearmonth":"202409","year":"2024","count":45,"questions":[{"no":1,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，这是当飞机起飞时机翼的截面图，下列说法正确的是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241024/17297602579436.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：机翼上侧的气流比下侧的气流速度慢"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：机翼受到整体向下的力的作用"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：机翼下侧所受的气压大于上侧"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：机翼上侧曲线弧度小于下侧"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":2,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"挖掘机的机械臂用到了下列哪个机构？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：凸轮机构"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：棘轮机构"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：槽轮机构"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：连杆机构"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":3,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"机器人常见的驱动方式不包括？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：电力驱动"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：液压驱动"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：手动驱动"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：气压驱动"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":4,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，曲柄滑块机构中滑块做什么动作？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241024/17297604145024.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：在既定的轨道上滑动"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：无规律动作"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：回转运动"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：左右摇摆"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":5,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"关于双动式棘轮，下列说法正确的是？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：只能单向运动"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：只能双向运动"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：只有一个主动棘爪"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：可以单向运动"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"A. 只能单向运动 ✅ 正确。 B. 只能双向运动 ❌ 错误，棘轮是单向运动，不是双向。 C. 只有一个主动棘爪 ❌ 错误，双动式棘轮有两个主动棘爪。 D. 可以单向运动 ✅ 说法正确，但注意 D 的“可以”不如 A 的“只能”严谨，因为棘轮不是可以选择单向或双向，而是设计上就只能单向运动。 通常此类单选题应选择最准确的描述。A 的表述“只能单向运动”比 D 的“可以单向运动”更精确地描述了其功能特性。","auto":true},{"no":6,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，采用了摆动型从动件的是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241024/17297605128055.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：a"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：b"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：c"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：d"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":7,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，关于该装置，下列说法正确的是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241024/17297605563854.jpeg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：这是皮带交叉传动装置"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：这是链传动装置"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：这是垂直啮合的齿轮"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：这是皮带平行传动装置"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":8,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，关于自行车，下列说法正确的是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241024/17297606147424.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：a处采用平行四边形结构来增加结构稳定性"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：b处相当于一个费力的轮轴"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：c处轮胎增加花纹来增大摩擦"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：d处采用了皮带传动"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":9,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"凸轮机构的从动件分类不包括？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：滚子从动件"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：方形从动件"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：尖顶从动件"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：平底从动件"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"按从动件的形状分类： 尖顶从动件：这种从动件结构简单，能与任意复杂的凸轮轮廓保持接触，但易磨损，适用于速度较低和传力不大的场合。 滚子从动件：在从动件端部安装一个滚轮，将滑动摩擦变为滚动摩擦，减小摩擦和磨损，可传递较大动力，应用广泛。 平底从动件：从动件与凸轮轮廓之间为线接触，润滑状况好，传动效率高，常用于高速场合。 曲面从动件：为了克服尖顶从动件的缺点，将从动件的端部做成曲面，这种结构在生产中应用较多。","auto":true},{"no":10,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，关于该机构，下列说法正确的是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241024/17297607916416.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：这是槽轮机构"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：这是不完全齿轮机构"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：这是棘轮机构"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：a是主动件"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":11,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"典型的棘轮机构不包括？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：棘轮"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：止回摆杆"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：止回棘爪"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：主动摆杆"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"棘轮不一定必须有止回摆杆。 棘轮机构是一种常见的机械传动装置，它由棘轮和棘爪组成，用于将连续转动或往复运动转换成单向步进运动。虽然止回摆杆在棘轮机构中扮演着重要角色，但它并非所有棘轮机构的必要组成部分。 止回摆杆的主要作用是防止棘轮在特定条件下发生反转。当主动件逆时针方向摆动时，止回摆杆上的止回棘爪会阻止棘轮发生逆时针方向转动，而驱动棘爪却能够在棘轮齿背上滑过，从而确保棘轮只能单向旋转。然而，在某些应用场景下，可能不需要止回摆杆，或者可以通过其他方式来实现防止逆转的功能。","auto":true},{"no":12,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，小孩用力推箱子，关于该场景说法正确的是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241024/17297610345732.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：箱子移动之前与地面之间产生的是滑动摩擦力"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：箱子与地面之间的最大静摩擦力大于滑动摩擦力"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：箱子和地面之间产生的是滚动摩擦力"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：箱子移动的时候与地面之间产生的是静摩擦力"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":13,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，下列哪个选项是外啮合棘轮机构？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241024/17297611119949.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：a"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：b"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：c"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：d"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":14,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，这是使用缝纫机的示意图，脚踏板上下摆动，上部轮子做回转运动，那么该场景相当于使用了？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241024/17297611613211.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：双曲柄机构"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：双摇杆机构"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：曲柄摇杆机构"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：反向双曲柄机构"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":15,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列装置中轮状零件的旋转方向一定相同的是？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：蜗轮蜗杆"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：皮带传动"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：齿轮传动"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：链传动"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":16,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"等条件下，通常下列哪个选项重力最大？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：一个西瓜"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：一块橡皮"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：一个芝麻"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：一只蚂蚁"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":17,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图该机构中止回棘爪是指？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241024/17297616327908.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：a"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：b"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：c"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：d"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":18,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"诸葛亮发明的“木牛流马”的作用是？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：运送军粮"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：娱乐"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：观测天文"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：计量长度"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":19,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，关于该凸轮机构，下列说法正确的是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241024/17297617125065.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：采用了移动型凸轮"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：采用了弹力锁合"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：采用了重力锁合"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：采用了滚子从动件"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":20,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，关于该机构的从动件，下列说法正确的是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241024/17297617661866.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：属于直动型从动件"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：属于摆动型从动件"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：属于平底从动件"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：属于尖顶从动件"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":21,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"人体能够承受的最大安全电压为？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：1.5V"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：36V"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：1000V"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：220V"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"人体能够承受的最大安全电压为不高于36V。 人体能承受的安全电压是根据电流通过人体的效应来确定的，主要取决于电流的大小和通电时间长短。一般来说，行业规定安全电压为不高于36V，持续接触安全电压为24V。这是因为当电压超过这个值时，通过人体的电流可能会达到危险的水平，对人体造成伤害甚至危及生命。","auto":true},{"no":22,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"关于齿轮，下列说法正确的是？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：齿轮平行啮合旋转方向相同"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：齿轮只能垂直啮合"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：齿轮啮合一定起加速作用"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：齿轮啮合适合近距离传动"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":23,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"一个六足机器人，用左右两个电机分别控制左右足，左侧电机转速是100rpm，右侧电机转速是50rpm，则此机器人？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：向右前方转向"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：原地右转"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：原地左转"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：原地不动"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":24,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"滑杆机构中的滑块一般做什么动作？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：左右摇摆"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：回转运动"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：静止不动"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：沿着轨道来回滑动"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":25,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，下列哪个是工业机器人？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241024/17297620182344.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：a"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：b"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：c"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：d"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":26,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，下列哪个是反向双曲柄机构？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241024/17297620605669.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：a"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：b"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：c"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：d"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":27,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，下列哪个是共轭型凸轮机构？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241024/17297621059661.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：a"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：b"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：c"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：d"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":28,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"关于能量说法错误的是？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：能量可以相互转化"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：能量可以从一个物体转移到另一个物体"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：机械能包括动能和势能"}]},{"key":"D","con